  },
  {
   "who": "ahe",
   "kind": "恩",
   "what": {
    "zh": "外门第一天，阿禾在小本子上记了你一笔：杂灵根。「哪天你不是了，好对账。」",
    "en": "Your first day in the outer sect: Ahe wrote you into the little notebook — mixed root. \"So we can check the books the day you're not.\""
   },
   "chapter": "00-waimen",
   "day": "2026-10-15",
   "at": "wm-ahe"
  },
  {
   "who": "zhouheng",
   "kind": "恩",
   "what": {
    "zh": "十月初八，周衡把药园巡夜令交给了你：「巡夜没好处，没人接。」又把半根蜡烛掰下一截给你。月底盘账，药园要是还在丢，令牌归马师兄。",
    "en": "The eighth of the tenth month, Zhou Heng handed you the herb garden's night-watch token: \"The night watch pays nothing; nobody takes it.\" He broke a piece off half a candle for you too. If the garden is still losing plants at the month-end reckoning, the token goes to senior brother Ma."
   },
   "chapter": "00-waimen",
